.TH elfshaker-esi-list 1  "elfshaker 1.0.0-rc1" "elfshaker Manual"
.SH NAME
elfshaker\-esi\-list \- List entries in a remote index
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBelfshaker esi list\fR <ESI_FILE>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the entries in ESI_FILE, one per line and in stored order. A v1 line contains the pack\-index checksum, pack checksum, and pack URL. A v2 line appends the pack size and pack\-index size in bytes. Fields are separated by tabs and no heading is printed.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show informational progress and diagnostic messages.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIESI_FILE\fR>
ESI file to list.
.SH EXAMPLES
Print the entries in a v2 index:
.PP
.nf
\fBelfshaker esi list index.v2.esi\fR
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
elfshaker\-esi(1), elfshaker\-esi\-add(1), elfshaker\-esi\-remove(1)
